{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261116/photo/bkn-20261116092016225-1116_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261116113238\"/><p>綿羊仔尾轆飛脫。</p><p>觀塘繞道發生交通意外。今日(16日)早上7時46分，一輛綿羊仔電單車沿路往旺角方向行駛，至近太子道東支路時自炒，綿羊仔尾轆飛脫，姓梁(22歲)鐵騎士左手及腳受傷清醒由救護車送院治理，肇事原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:51:52.459519+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T01:20:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T14:12:20.126832+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T03:45:24.061395+00:00","content_hash":"acc292b4c72d75bb55d8380d9bf180b21fe765d2a9ba13a34e8484cc0d6fc965","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:51:52.459519+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}